				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Of course, when an expansion fails, what it became is nothing at all, and that is exactly when we want to see how it got there. Luckily, there’s a debugger for that. Onwards!"
			}
